    <p class="projectdescription is-size-5">
This project merged 70% CGI with 30% photography to create rich landscapes that my partner, James Adamé, and I delivered under a very tight deadline. My role focused on building the 3D worlds that served as the foundation of the campaign and blending them with photography through detailed compositing. The work was showcased in the United States, Germany, and Japan, and was met with plenty of high-fives and “right-ons.”    </p>
